ysis","Energy Estimation","Carbon Estimation","Optimization Recommendation"]},{"type":"p","text":"This allows engineers to optimize cost, performance and environmental impact simultaneously."}]},{"heading":"Carbon Data Engineering","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how sustainability data is collected and transformed."},{"type":"h","text":"Data sources"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud infrastructure"},{"text":"Electricity consumption"},{"text":"Smart meters"},{"text":"IoT sensors"},{"text":"Transportation systems"},{"text":"Supply-chain systems"},{"text":"Enterprise databases"},{"text":"Utility APIs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Pipeline"},{"type":"flow","items":["Raw Data","Data Ingestion","Validation","Transformation","Emission Factors","CO₂e Calculation","Data Warehouse","Dashboard/API"]}]},{"heading":"IoT & Energy Monitoring","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"IoT knowledge is useful for sustainability technology."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sensors"},{"text":"Smart meters"},{"text":"MQTT"},{"text":"HTTP"},{"text":"Edge computing"},{"text":"Time-series databases"},{"text":"Device telemetry"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful technologies:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESP32"},{"text":"Raspberry Pi"},{"text":"MQTT"},{"text":"InfluxDB"},{"text":"Grafana"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Energy Sensor","ESP32","MQTT","Cloud","Time-Series Database","Analytics","Energy Dashboard"]}]},{"heading":"AI/ML for Sustainability","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI can become an important specialization."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Time-series forecasting"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"},{"text":"Optimization"},{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Possible applications"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy-demand forecasting"},{"text":"Carbon-emission prediction"},{"text":"